> [!proposal] **Define Standardized Macros for Definitions and Scripts**  
> **Explanation:** To ensure consistency across the document, I propose introducing standardized macros—such as `[!definition]` and `[!script]`—that provide templates for common content. This standardization will simplify updating and reusing these snippets and provide clear instructions for contributors.  
> **Sample Fragment:**  

```markdown
>
> ```[!definition]
> Macro: snippet_definition
> Description: "Defines a template for code snippet blocks used in DSL specifications."
> Instructions: "Use this macro to annotate and standardize definitions throughout the document."
> ```
> 
> ```[!script]
> Macro: bootstrap_script
> Description: "Template for bootstrapping operations using VIM macros and shell commands."
> Instructions: "Incorporate this template whenever a bootstrapping script is needed."
> ```
```

